tal leading to questions about when  their violence will decrease yad sneeze  the ceasefire issue will be discussed in  talks directly between the Taliban and  Afghan government and that is part of  our deal with the Taliban the Taliban  will gradually decrease fighting which  will lead to a ceasefire something that  for Afghans can't come soon enough  Charlotte Bellis al Jazeera
 

